Phase 2 — Lateral Movement (T1534):
Using the initial victim's OAuth token (INITIAL_USER_TOKEN), the attacker calls POST
/v1.0/users/m.johnson@contoso.com/sendMail to send an internal spearphishing email
to the CFO (finance executive s.patel@contoso.com). The email contains an identical
OAuth redirect link themed as an internal document approval request. Because the email
originates from a trusted internal colleague, it bypasses external mail filtering.

